## 1. Introduction  
This test strategy defines the validation approach for Jira API authentication and error handling for inaccessible issue descriptions, as encountered in Issue AD-488.

---

## 2. Project Overview  
The project aims to ensure robust authentication to the Jira API and resilient handling of missing or unauthorized issue descriptions. Functional validation of AD-488 requirements is out of scope due to lack of description access.

---

## 3. Test Scope

### 3.2 Test Scope

#### 3.2.1 In Scope
- Jira API authentication validation
- Error handling for missing description

#### 3.2.2 Out of Scope
- Functional testing of AD-488 requirements (not possible without description)

---

